{"date":"2012-06-27","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/bb/70/45810_h2h1a.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/bb/70/45810_h2h1a.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/bb/70/45810_h2h1a.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/bb/70/45810_h2h1a.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/bb/70/45810_h2h1a.jpg"},"summary":"　　《冰川时代4》讲述的依然是那些生活在冰川时期的特殊动物“家庭”经历的冒险故事。那只永远追着松果的无敌贱，又苦逼的小松鼠奎特（克里斯·韦奇 Chris Wedge 配音 ）这次搞出了更大的事件，一个不小心让大陆板块四分五裂，使得猛犸象曼尼（雷·罗马诺 Ray Roman o 配音）、树懒希德（约翰·雷吉扎莫 John Leguizamo 配音）以及剑齿虎迪亚哥（丹尼斯·利瑞 Denis Leary 配音）因此和家人、伙伴失散分离，在板块激烈的运动并分裂漂移后，只能使用一块流冰作为临时的船只，展开一段惊奇的海上大冒险，在海上他们会遭遇险恶的自然环境，也会遇到海盗，而回家与家人团聚是他们的终极愿望，他们最后能否顺利回家呢？","name":"Ice Age: Continental Drift","name_cn":"冰川时代4：大陆漂移","tags":[{"name":"欧美","count":220,"total_count":86976},{"name":"剧场版","count":165,"total_count":726356},{"name":"冰河世纪","count":119,"total_count":561},{"name":"2012","count":110,"total_count":55778},{"name":"3D","count":77,"total_count":51212},{"name":"搞笑","count":75,"total_count":640716},{"name":"动画电影","count":73,"total_count":43987},{"name":"蓝天工作室","count":68,"total_count":506},{"name":"美国","count":43,"total_count":27212},{"name":"原创","count":41,"total_count":622112},{"name":"电影","count":33,"total_count":13625},{"name":"治愈","count":20,"total_count":302558},{"name":"童年","count":16,"total_count":93245},{"name":"迪亞哥娘娘","count":10,"total_count":10},{"name":"映画","count":9,"total_count":6312},{"name":"冒险","count":9,"total_count":54274},{"name":"喜剧","count":6,"total_count":35554},{"name":"喜得阿罵超威","count":6,"total_count":6},{"name":"Blue_sky_studios","count":5,"total_count":34},{"name":"补标","count":4,"total_count":2874},{"name":"20th_Century_Fox_Animation","count":3,"total_count":8},{"name":"2012年","count":3,"total_count":3309},{"name":"4D","count":3,"total_count":9},{"name":"2012年6月","count":3,"total_count":377},{"name":"动画","count":3,"total_count":35757},{"name":"欧美动画电影","count":2,"total_count":96},{"name":"